# OAuth client ID for Google Drive sync (Phase 3).
# Leave blank for local-only mode -- the editor works fully without it.
#
# This is NOT a secret. Installed apps ship their client ID in the bundle by
# design and there is no client secret. Committing it is fine.
#
# See docs/google-cloud-setup.md for how to create one.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
